              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Uwiteka abwirira Mose mu kibaya cy'i Mowabu kinini, kuri Yorodani ahateganye n'i Yeriko ati ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tegeka Abisirayeli bahe Abalewi imidugudu baturamo, bayikuye mu myandu bahawe ho gakondo, mubahe n'inzuri zigose iyo midugudu impande zose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imidugudu bayibemo ubwabo, inzuri zibemo ubutunzi bwabo, zibe izo kuragirwamo amashyo yabo n'amatungo yabo yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inzuri zo ku midugudu muzaha Abalewi, zihere ku nkike z'imidugudu zigeze impande zose, ahaterwa intambwe magana atanu z'ibirenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi inyuma y'iyo midugudu muzagere intambwe igihumbi iruhande rw'iburasirazuba, n'izindi igihumbi iruhande rw'ikusi, n'izindi igihumbi iruhande rw'iburengerazuba, n'izindi igihumbi iruhande rw'ikasikazi, imidugudu iri hagati. Inzuri zo ku midugudu yabo zigerwe zityo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imidugudu muzaha Abalewi ibemo imidugudu itandatu y'ubuhungiro, muzaba mukwiriye gutanga ngo gatozi wishe umuntu ayihungiremo, kandi muyongereho indi mirongo ine n'ibiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imidugudu yose muzaha Abalewi ibe mirongo ine n'umunani, muzayibahane n'inzuri zo kuri yo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imidugudu muzakura kuri gakondo z'Abisirayeli mukayiha Abalewi, ku benshi muzakureho myinshi, ku bake muzakureho mike. Umuntu wese uko gakondo yahawe ingana, abe ari ko aha Abalewi ku midugudu ye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
